          - status

---
kind: Command
version: v1
definition:
  name: ProcessClaim_2
  outputType: ProcessClaim!
  arguments:
    - name: claim
      type: ProcessClaimClaim!
  source:
    dataConnectorName: py_buisness_logic_1
    dataConnectorCommand:
      procedure: process_claim
  graphql:
    rootFieldName: processClaimPy
    rootFieldKind: Mutation
  description: "Processes and adjudicates insurance claim using Python implementation. Validates eligibility, checks benefit coverage, applies plan rules (copay/coinsurance/deductible), and determines approval status. Returns approved amount, processing time, and rejection reason if denied. Executes real-time claim adjudication workflow. Algorithmically equivalent to Go and TypeScript implementations."

